~ start
Greetings, Your Highness.
I'm certain you know all this, but may you entertain my nerves and allow me to explain your responsibilities?
- yes
	do ui.tutorial.set_advisor_expression(Tutorial.STATE.HAPPY)
	Alright! I'll try to make this quick and thorough.
	do ui.tutorial.set_advisor_expression(Tutorial.STATE.NORM)
	do ui.tutorial.highlight_cards(true)
	Every night, you'll receive more resources to manage, which you choose here.
	do ui.tutorial.set_advisor_expression(Tutorial.STATE.PROUD)
	do ui.tutorial.highlight_cards(false)
	Of course, we've prepared extra to start our colony off with, so you'll have a lot to work with early on.
	do ui.tutorial.set_advisor_expression(Tutorial.STATE.NORM)
	Feel free to pick what units catch your eye.
	
- no
	do ui.tutorial.set_advisor_expression(Tutorial.STATE.NERV)
	Alright sir. Apologies for my intrusion. I'm certain you'll bring us through this invasion.

=> END